[en.FOCUS_C08_STARLIGHT_RADIO]
Starlight Radio

[en.FOCUS_C08_STARLIGHT_RADIO_desc]
Apart from the physical liberation of Marelia, spiritual liberation is also important. A radio station that can be heard all over the world will awaken the oppressed ponies, make them join our ranks, and shake the foundation of the false empire.

[en.FOCUS_C08_STARLIGHT_RADIO_TOOLTIP]
Unlock a series of decisions: §YStarlight Radio§!

[zh.FOCUS_C08_STARLIGHT_RADIO]
星光电台

[zh.FOCUS_C08_STARLIGHT_RADIO_desc]
除了物理上解放小马利亚，精神上的解放也十分重要。一部能够让全世界收到的电台将唤醒被压迫的小马们，让他们加入我们的行列，动摇伪帝国的根基。

[zh.FOCUS_C08_STARLIGHT_RADIO_TOOLTIP]
解锁系列决议：§Y星光电台§!

